The genome in data/genome/ is the Trypanosoma brucei TREU927 assembly of
TriTrypDB release 56 (https://tritrypdb.org) with Tb427 VSG sequences added,
redistributed here for reproducibility; cite TriTrypDB when using it. The
annotated non-coding RNA genes in data/annotation/ are from Ensembl Protists
release 116. The sequencing reads were produced by Kruse and Goringer
(Genes 2023, ENA PRJEB60364); the read ids and end positions derived from
them are redistributed under the same CC BY 4.0 terms.
